# ============================================================
# plan: thermal_cycle -- three cycles between 60 and -20 °C
# ============================================================
# Cycles the platen and shroud between hot and cold under rough vacuum, a quarter
# hour at each end, then returns the chamber to air. Cooling uses liquid nitrogen:
# its supply must be on and its exhaust vented outside the building.
#
# Start: ambient. The chamber at atmosphere with its door closed, the platen and
#   shroud between 10 and 60 °C, liquid nitrogen supplied.
# End:   at atmosphere, the vent valve open. Both zones off, both pumps off.
# Fails: the chamber is not at atmosphere at the start, does not reach 5 Torr
#   within 20 minutes, a zone does not reach its temperature within the time
#   given for each step, or the chamber does not return to air.
#
# Takes at least 2 hours 30 minutes; longer if the zones are slow. Cooling has not
# yet been run on this chamber through formsLabCLI.

load rLACO
record every 30 s

begin at ambient
pumpdown to 5 Torr
repeat 3 times
  warm to 60 C within 90 min
  hold 15 min
  cool to -20 C within 120 min
  hold 15 min
end

warm to 20 C within 90 min
hvc platen off
hvc shroud off
vent within 60 min
log three cycles done and back at atmosphere
